[en.FOCUS_C18_100_MILITARY_RESEARCH]
Kirins Military Complex

[en.FOCUS_C18_100_MILITARY_RESEARCH_desc]
After seeing the outside world, the Kirins finally realized that they were in the midst of a great change: unicorns in the pony factories were being replaced by machines; magic was being replaced by steam, oil, and electricity; weapons were being replaced by guns; and mail was being replaced by radio...\nA modern heavy industry enterprise, a concept that is quite unfamiliar to the Kirins, may be the future direction they once overlooked. And one of the more sensitive attempts is: Military Complex.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_100_MILITARY_RESEARCH]
麒麟重工

[zh.FOCUS_C18_100_MILITARY_RESEARCH_desc]
再见识到外界世界后，麒麟们终于意识到自己正置身于一场巨大的变革中：小马工厂中的独角兽正在被机器取代；魔法正在被蒸汽、石油与电力取代；兵器正在被枪支取代；邮件正在被电台取代...\n现代化重工企业，一个对于麒麟来说相当陌生的概念，或许正是他们曾经忽略的未来方向。而其中一个更加敏感的尝试是：军工企业。

